# =============================================================================
# PLATFORM-SPECIFIC NOTES:
# =============================================================================
# 
# Docker/Docker Compose:
# - Use docker-compose.yml env_file directive
# - Or use environment: section with ${VAR_NAME}
#
# Kubernetes:
# - Create ConfigMap for non-sensitive data
# - Create Secret for passwords
# - Use envFrom in deployment.yaml
#
# Render.com / Heroku / Railway:
# - Copy these variable names and values to platform's environment config
#
# AWS ECS / Lambda:
# - Add to task definition environment variables
#
# Local Development:
# - Load .env file automatically with your IDE or dotenv library
# =============================================================================
